From be2db4dc2cf31f52f2b3b476befa1f5de7c8f102 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aspen <aspeninifeltner@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:25:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Zarchive loading (#724): common, kernel and emulator side

Port of upstream KytyPS5 commit 4b0de1b6 (without the launcher changes, which
follow in the next commit) onto ds-chenxiao-sync.

Adaptations for this branch:
- file.cpp: keep this branch's string-based directory helpers and add the
  archive-path guards on top of them.
- fileSystem.cpp: keep the _GameOverrides /app0 replacement and the
  Demon's Souls/GameArgs stat size redirect; use info->size for the fallback.
- add Common::PathFromUtf8 (from upstream b61b3f2a), which the archive code uses.
- tests: ArchiveFileTests reads ByteBuffer through a small helper; upstream's
  KernelFileSystemTests additions are left out (they assume upstream's
  unmapped-path semantics).

(cherry picked from commit 4b0de1b6)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
